    "description": "A lightweight Lucky Block add-on for TACZ. It's not a Lucky Block add-on mod, so you don't have to include the Lucky Block mod. Break the block to get a random gun from 70+ default TACZ firearms, along with its perfectly matched ammo. Ready to fire, no mismatches!  这是一个基于 TACZ 的轻量级幸运方块附属模组。 这不是一个幸运方块的附加模组，所以你不需要安装幸运方块模组。 挖掉方块，即可随机获得一把包含 70+ 种默认枪械的武器，并严格附带相匹配的专属子弹，开箱即战，绝不配错！"
